#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.gcompris.appdata.xml:16
msgid "GCompris"
msgstr "GCompris"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.gcompris.appdata.xml:17
msgid "Educational game for children"
msgstr "Obrazovna igra za djecu"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.gcompris.appdata.xml:19
msgid "GCompris is a high quality educational software suite, including a large number of activities for children aged 2 to 10."
msgstr "GCompris je visokokvalitetni obrazovni programski paket koji uključuje velik broj aktivnosti za djecu od 2 do 10 godina."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.gcompris.appdata.xml:20
msgid "Some of the activities are game orientated, but nonetheless still educational."
msgstr "Neke od aktivnosti su orijentirane na igru, ali su ipak edukativne."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.gcompris.appdata.xml:22
msgid "Below you can find a list of categories with some of the activities available in that category."
msgstr "Ispod možete pronaći popis kategorija s nekim od dostupnih aktivnosti u svakoj od njih."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.gcompris.appdata.xml:25
msgid "computer discovery: keyboard, mouse, different mouse gestures, etc."
msgstr "otkrivanje računala: tipkovnica, miš, različite geste mišem, itd."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.gcompris.appdata.xml:26
msgid "arithmetic: table memory, enumeration, mirror image, balance the scale, change giving, etc."
msgstr "aritmetika: tablica množenja, nabrajanje, zrcalna slika, ravnoteža vage, davanje promjena, itd."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.gcompris.appdata.xml:28
msgid "science: the canal lock, color mixing, gravity concept, etc."
msgstr "znanost: sustav brana, miješanje boja, koncept gravitacije, itd."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.gcompris.appdata.xml:29
msgid "games: memory, connect 4, tic tac toe, sudoku, hanoi tower, etc."
msgstr "igrice: igra pamćenja, Connect 4, tic tac toe, sudoku, Hanojski tornjevi, itd."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.gcompris.appdata.xml:30
msgid "reading: reading practice, etc."
msgstr "čitanje: vježbe čitanja, itd."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.gcompris.appdata.xml:31
msgid "other: learn to tell time, the braille system, maze, music instruments, etc."
msgstr "ostalo: nauči odrediti vrijeme, Brailleovo pismo, labirint, glazbeni instrumenti, itd."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.gcompris.appdata.xml:34
msgid "Currently GCompris offers in excess of 100 activities and more are being developed. GCompris is free software, that means that you can adapt it to your own needs, improve it and, most importantly, share it with children everywhere."
msgstr "Trenutačno GCompris nudi više od 100 aktivnosti, ali i dalje se nove razvijaju. GCompris je besplatan softver, što znači da ga možete prilagoditi svojim potrebama, poboljšati i, što je najvažnije, podijeliti s djecom posvuda."

